  <h2>Caveats</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>When used with non-zero <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/VEHICLE_HOVER_HEIGHT" target="_blank">VEHICLE_HOVER_HEIGHT</a> and <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/VEHICLE_BUOYANCY" target="_blank">VEHICLE_BUOYANCY</a> then the buoyancy effect will be disabled when the vehicle&#39;s (root prim) position is higher than its hover height.
    <ul>
      <li>This has been confirmed to be a misfeature[[1]](#footnote_1).</li>
    </ul>
  
    </li>
  </ul>
